DATA / ADR NOTES
  * Data source: useCostBreakdown -> GET /analytics/tco [vehicle_id], bound through
    the @Observable TrueCostPageModel via the TrueCostDataSource seam (ADR-004 — no
    networking in the view). loading/empty/error/success each implemented.
  * SI at the boundary (ADR-005): TrueCostBreakdown stores meters/Wh; distance/energy
    convert via the shared Units facade only at render (TrueCostFormat + useUnits env).
  * Charts are native Swift Charts wrappers (TSAreaChart/TSBarChart) — no WKWebView.
  * i18n via LocalizedStringKey / String(localized:) with the web key names (ADR-014).
  * a11y: accessibilityLabel on charts/panels, combined elements, Dynamic Type fonts,
    light/dark via design tokens (ADR-015). Adaptive macOS/iOS via horizontalSizeClass
    (ADR-002/006).

